<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;" color="#3333ff"><b style="">Candidate Information:</b></font><div style=""><ul style=""><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Name:&nbsp;</b>{!AVTRRT__Job_Applicant__c.Candidate_Name__c}<b><br></b></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Specialty:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Contact.Abrv_Job_Title__c}</font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Years of Experience:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.AVTRRT__Total_Experience_Years__c}</font></li><li style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Years of Travel Experience:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Contact.How_long_have_you_been_a_traveler__c}</font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">What EMR experience? (i.e. EPIC, meditech,etc):&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.EHR_Systems__c}</font></li></ul><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style=""><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Active State Licenses:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.State_Licenses__c}</font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Certifications:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.Certifications__c}</font></li></ul><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><font face="arial"><b>Is Candidate open to 26 week assignment?:&nbsp;</b></font></li></ul></div><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Available Start Date:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.AVTRRT__Available_To_Start__c}</font></li><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Requested Time Off:&nbsp;</b></font></li></ul><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Phone:</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!Contact.MobilePhone}</font></li><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Email:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.Email}</font></li><li><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Best time/day to reach:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.Best_time_day_to_reach_you__c}</font></li></ul><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Permanent Address (on DL):</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Contact.Permanent_Address__c}</font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Mileage from perm address to facility?:</b></font></li></ul><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Date of Birth:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.Birthdate}</font></li><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Social Security Number:&nbsp;</b></li><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Covid Vaccination Status:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.COVID_Vaccination_Status__c}</font></li></ul><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style=""><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">BILL RATE:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!AVTRRT__Job_Applicant__c.AVTRRT__Bill_Rates__c}</font></li></ul><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Why Hire This Candidate (Bio):&nbsp;</b></li></ul><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li><font face="arial"><b>Willing to accept auto-offer?:</b></font></li></ul></div>]]></td>
